    "body": "So in Gecko, the following does not redirect\n\n```\n0url=.\n```\n\nbut this does\n\n```\n0 url=.\n```\n\nbut these redirect to \"; url=.\" or \", ; url=.\"\n\n```\n0 ; ; url=.\n0 ; , ; url=.\n```\n\nHowever in IE11, all the above redirect to \".\".\n",
