    "body": "@zcorpan would you mind maybe pulling together a table of possible inputs, with links to appropriate live-dom-viewer tests we could run? We could then pull together a compat table showing what implementations do; e.g. I have access to Edge. And then we could turn them into web-platform-tests.\n\nAlternately we could find the appropriate parsing code inside each engine, except for Edge I guess.\n\n/cc @travisleithead since I know Edge was working on this compat edge case; if he could give us a description of Edge's current algorithm, that would be pretty great.\n",
