    "body": "A. [no redirect](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3683)\nB. [redirect to the part after \"url=\"](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3684)\nC. [redirect to the part after the first \";\"](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3685)\nD. [redirect to the document's current address](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3686)\nE. some kind of infinitely nested series of iframes that crashes the browser\n\n| Test | IE11 | Edge | Gecko | Blink | WebKit | notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [`0url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3687) | D? E? | E | A | A | A | 0 instances in webdevdata |\n| [`0 url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3688) | B | B | B | A | A | bugs filed on blink/webkit |\n| [`0 ; ; url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3689) | B | B | C | C | C | 0 instances in webdevdata |\n| [`0; 0; url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3691) | D | C | C | C | C | 1 instance of `0; /en/` in webdevdata |\n| [`+2; url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3693) | A | A | B | B | B |  |\n| [`-0; url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3695) | A | A | B | B | B |  |\n| [`-1; url=../`](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/3696) | A | A | A | A | A |  |\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
