    "body": "Oops, `0url=../` was D in IE11, not B (unless it's actually E but I can't tell the difference with browserstack?).\n\n`0; 0; url=../` was intended to be the \"omit url=\" test, though it's not super-clear, but it appears that Edge changed behavior for that test.\n",
