    "body": "@zcorpan sorry for the delay. I have reviewed the spec and it looks good to me. The tests don't run in Chrome since they use destructuring but after transpiling they do and all pass, which is great. (They also all pass in Firefox.) I'm a bit surprised you couldn't find any test cases that show divergence between those two :)\n\nI think we should merge this as it's a clear improvement over the status quo. I'd still love some input from Microsoft (@travisleithead?) since I know this was one of their main interop concerns.\n",
